The licence covers the identified course material; it does not grant rights in
Vitaly Vorobyev's personal name, likeness or endorsement. Source provenance and
copyrightability are separate questions: an asset marked `simulated` is identified
as course-created, not automatically asserted to be independently copyrightable.

Note on `data/goethe-a1-wortliste.txt` (outside this directory): it is a plain
list of headwords used to measure coverage against the Goethe-Institut A1
Wortliste. The Wortliste itself is published by the Goethe-Institut and is not
covered by this licence.

Note on `data/lid/` and `public/lid/` (outside this directory): they hold the official
question catalogue of the test „Leben in Deutschland“ / Einbürgerungstest — Anlage 1 of the
EinbTestV, in the edition published by the Bundesamt für Migration und Flüchtlinge — reproduced
unchanged. It is an official work (§5 UrhG) and is not covered by this licence. The course's
notes on it — topic assignments, explanations and translations under `lid/` — are.

The lesson figures in `public/lid/lessons/` are not one thing. A diagram drawn for the course
(`sourceClass: simulated` in its lesson's `figures:`) is covered by this licence. Every other
figure keeps the licence its `figures:` entry names: Wikimedia Commons works under their own
Creative Commons or public-domain terms, and excerpts of the official catalogue as official
works (§5 UrhG).
